    "dataset": "research-multihop",
    "name": "Research notes — multi-hop",
    "language": "en",
    "description": "Synthetic English reading notes following one replication dispute across eight months. Deliberately weighted to multi-hop and aggregation: most answers need two or three sessions, so a pipeline that retrieves one perfect chunk still scores badly. All authors, institutions and findings are fictional.",
